  (text "R1 = R2 = 10k with C1 = 22n and C2 = 10n gives f = 1073 Hz and" (at 18.0 30.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0fde8ba0-a72d-56c1-9c34-4e9dec1bd128"))
  (text "Q = 0.742. Butterworth wants Q = 0.707, which is 11 nF - a value" (at 18.0 35.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c5ac875f-4af0-54ce-b986-01484cdf689e"))
  (text "one cannot buy in C0G, and C0G is what keeps the corner where it is." (at 18.0 40.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e571cd9f-5cd8-5fc5-9c76-eece50d3e9ce"))
  (text "An X7R of the same size loses a third of its value over the rail." (at 18.0 45.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2c6aa0ec-6cc6-566e-8259-718f16715b88"))
  (text "VREF is half the rail: R3/R4 make it and U2 buffers it. The filter's" (at 18.0 50.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0d3537a0-1ce9-582f-9734-ea5b7fce09b9"))
  (text "return flows into that node through C2, and a bare divider is a" (at 18.0 55.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f270a2ae-e1b1-5281-9c80-ad20e74a03b8"))
  (text "50k source impedance - the filter would not be this filter." (at 18.0 60.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "845e8cfb-5268-5e98-8f4d-5f27069105fa"))
  (text "C3 and C6 couple in and out, so the header sees no DC. R5 sets the" (at 18.0 65.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8a1cb79c-4e7b-55f3-a7fa-58085f55c859"))
  (text "input's own operating point at VREF and loads the source with 100k." (at 18.0 70.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1e548479-f7c4-51f2-bfee-ca2d11883bf4"))
  (text "R6 and R7 bleed the far sides of the coupling caps to ground:" (at 18.0 75.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f9fbec75-10dc-5e5f-bb41-5d3dee4e986f"))
  (text "without them those nodes float at whatever they last charged to," (at 18.0 80.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5af54b4e-50af-5cfc-a245-601f92db3b39"))
  (text "and plugging anything in pops." (at 18.0 86.04 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8650a6c9-94d5-597b-aa45-c80f866f0166"))
